{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33402","headline":"赠春游侣 · 李昌符","name":"赠春游侣","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"密林多暗香，轻吹送余芳。\n啼鸟愁春尽，游人喜日长。\n浮云横暮色，新雨洗韶光。\n欲散垂□恨，应须入醉乡。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李昌符","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33402.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33402","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}